person.gray and no_person.gray are TensorFlow Lite Micro's person detection test pictures,
tensorflow/lite/micro/examples/person_detection/testdata/person.bmp and no_person.bmp, from
https://github.com/tensorflow/tflite-micro at commit cefb91622f507275fc6690f475ccec6650edd076.
